  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at contributing to the achievement of the NHS and the HSR&apos;s main goal of improving the health standards of the population through increasing access to and quality of pubic healthcare services at the tertiary level.  The specific objective of the project is to enhance the specialized healthcare services provided by Al-Azhar Institution through the completion of AUSH.</narrative>
